<title>USA: Waukesha Cty, Wis., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Waukesha Cty, Wis., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc. said it won $9.800 million of Waukesha Cty, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.69 percent.</p>
</text>
